For upward propagation, I need to build reverse edges. When A imports B, the forward edge is A→B. 

The reverse edge is B→A, so when B gets tagged, I can traverse back to A (the importer) and tag it too. To build this reverse index, I'll iterate through each segment's imports, resolve them to their target segments, and record the reverse mapping from target back to importer.

